/home/y-saito/Developments/ec-cube-enterprise/app/DoctrineMigrations/sql/mtb_card_detail_1.sql:39066:','Deep in a murmuring bosk, where the trees'' memories span centuries, the simple banner of green and copper signifies an elder whose rings number more than a faerie''s days.','あなたが唱えるツリーフォーク(Treefolk)呪文とシャーマン(Shaman)呪文は、それを唱えるためのコストが(１)少なくなる。','Treefolk spells and Shaman spells you cast cost {1} less to cast.','1','3','114',0,false,0,'2018-07-07 02:04:41+09','2025-07-31 21:28:06+09'),
